ext","blocks":{"template--14500204806273__8b8a9eb2-226b-4dd2-a094-0e226585653f-16861416884202f633-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Our high-quality premium sports mats are meticulously crafted"}},"template--14500204806273__8b8a9eb2-226b-4dd2-a094-0e226585653f-16861416884202f633-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>To provide you with the ultimate training experience. Engineered with top-of-the-line materials and cutting-edge technology, these mats offer unmatched performance, durability, and comfort. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14500204806273__8b8a9eb2-226b-4dd2-a094-0e226585653f-16861416884202f633-0","template--14500204806273__8b8a9eb2-226b-4dd2-a094-0e226585653f-16861416884202f633-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"d76b6437-f68d-41ec-bc26-30f535853d6b":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"a3d01d39-e9bc-4607-832c-a0160d67f071":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4_71b06699-cafc-4d46-863f-9b55a10be5ae.png","image_width":400,"title":"HIGH-QUALITY FOAM","text":"<p>Made from high-quality foam materials, these mats offer <strong>optimal cushioning, impact absorption, and support<\/strong> for your workouts. Experience the perfect blend of comfort and durability as you push your limits in activities like gymnastics, martial arts, or general fitness training.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14500204806273__d76b6437-f68d-41ec-bc26-30f535853d6b-16861417166e50be49-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_d538efc9-367b-43b1-bd8e-2fc99273e6a1.png","image_width":400,"title":"Experience Hygienic Excellence","text":"<p>Our vinyl sports mats feature <strong>advanced antimicrobial properties that inhibit the growth of bacteria and fungi<\/strong>. Experience a clean and protected environment, free from odors and potential infections. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14500204806273__d76b6437-f68d-41ec-bc26-30f535853d6b-16861417166e50be49-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_c698d7be-eb35-4578-8147-44ff4e2a9b01.png","image_width":400,"title":"Unrivaled Durability","text":"<p><strong>Made out of 18 oz. heavy duty vinyl<\/strong>, these tumbling mats can withstand the toughest of activities. With exceptional durability and resilience, they deliver long-lasting performance and reliable protection for your intense workouts. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"6141a16e-2130-4e64-8525-b2a2de2ebc69":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/easy_to_store_and_carry.jpg","image_width":400,"title":"Convenience meets performance","text":"<p>Designed for easy transport and storage, our foldable sports mats offer the perfect balance of portability and functionality. Engineered with premium materials, they <strong>maintain their durability and performance even after repeated folding and unfolding<\/strong>. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["a3d01d39-e9bc-4607-832c-a0160d67f071","template--14500204806273__d76b6437-f68d-41ec-bc26-30f535853d6b-16861417166e50be49-0","template--14500204806273__d76b6437-f68d-41ec-bc26-30f535853d6b-16861417166e50be49-1","6141a16e-2130-4e64-8525-b2a2de2ebc69"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"095ed1b2-f31e-4127-a303-8d3419bd6d98":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"f777cf36-c906-4c30-84b3-1340433835e7":{"type":"image","settings":{"top_subheading":"","title":"Expertly Curated","title_size":60,"subheading":"Discover Excellence in Every Move with Our Line of Sports Mats","link":"","link_text":"","link_2":"","link_text_2":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-center horizontal-center","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_5c419c9d-7984-4700-9d04-40875acea967.png","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_1_9ba4e245-adf6-4ee8-baa8-8078edbb7edf.png","parallax_direction":"top","overlay_opacity":0,"focal_point":"bottom center"}}},"block_order":["f777cf36-c906-4c30-84b3-1340433835e7"],"settings":{"section_height":"natural","mobile_height":"auto","parallax":false,"style":"bars","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5}},"65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cross-Linked_PE_Foam_2_1.gif","image_width":650,"title":"1-3\/8” CROSS LINK FOAM MATS","text":"<p><strong>Engineered to enhance stability and prevent your feet from digging in<\/strong>, this premium foam provides unparalleled firmness that minimizes the risk of injuries during  intense training sessions.<\/p>","button_label":"buy 1-3\/8\" cross link foam mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/tumbling-super-mats"}},"template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cross-Linked_PE_Foam_2_1.gif","image_width":650,"title":"2” CROSS LINK FOAM MATS","text":"<p>Our meticulously designed mats offer a firm foundation, providing a <strong>stable foot setting<\/strong> and unmatched stability for sports activities. Experience <strong>greater shock absorption<\/strong> capabilities that effectively minimize impact, safeguarding your body during intense training sessions.<\/p>","button_label":"buy 2\" cross link foam mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/karate-mats"}},"template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dual_Foam_Cora.gif","image_width":650,"title":"COMBO MARTIAL ARTS MATS","text":"<p>A combination of Cross link and Rebond foams creates the perfect folding gym mat. <strong>Firm on the top to provide support and prevent your feet digging in while absorbent at bottom for added shock absorption.<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"buy combo martial arts mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/combo-gymnastic-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-0","template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-1","template--14487883382913__65e4f417-6a95-4ba9-b430-6c6b077ee121-167931168047b25a76-2"],"settings":{"title":"FOLDABLE MATS","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"b42692c6-a43e-441c-b168-d54655d98085":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"512821dd-37fd-44de-9c1e-5142fd34e84d":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rebond_Foam_1.gif","image_width":530,"title":"ALL-PURPOSE TUMBLING MATS","text":"<p>Rebond foam is made from recycled foam pieces bonded together. It offers <strong>superior shock absorption and durability<\/strong>, making it a popular choice for activities that require heavy tumbling and falls.<\/p><p><em>Starting at $8.09\/sq ft.<\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY ALL-PURPOSE TUMBLING MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/all-purpose-tumbling-mats"}},"5ca86cf4-325a-4448-9d34-3d3a837c5bb7":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/03b.gif","image_width":530,"title":"VARSITY EXERCISE MAT","text":"<p>PU foam is a dense and durable foam that provides <strong>excellent shock absorption and cushioning<\/strong>, making it suitable for general workouts as well as some falling and tumbling.<\/p><p><em>Starting at $9.88\/sq ft.<\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VARSITY EXERCISE MAT","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/varsity-folding-mats"}}},"block_order":["512821dd-37fd-44de-9c1e-5142fd34e84d","5ca86cf4-325a-4448-9d34-3d3a837c5bb7"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"fcd9c5ad-ae41-4056-b1e5-76a6a829815a":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"1067155